# Liquid Tank Level - Height / Input Flow
# First Order System
#
# Model: A*dh/dt + a*h = Qin
# H(p) = (1/a) / (1 + (A/a)*p)
#
# A = 2.0 m^2 (tank cross section), a = 0.5 m^2 (outlet coefficient)
# K = 1/a = 2.0 m/m^3.s^-1, tau = A/a = 4.0 s
#
# Numerator coefficients (ascending powers of p)
: 2.0
# Denominator coefficients (ascending powers of p)
:: 1 4.0
